                        <li>Worked with WordPress, handling customization and plugin integration.</li>
                        <li>Integrated and tested RESTful APIs for mobile app connectivity using Postman.</li>
                      </ul>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                      <ul class="list-disc pl-5">
                        <li>Implemented SEO improvements and optimized website load performance.</li>
                        <li>Utilized Git and GitHub for version control and collaboration.</li>
                        <li>Managed hosting and deployment using cPanel.</li>
                      </ul>
                    </div>
