                      <ul class="list-disc pl-5">
                        <li>Contributed to the development of an internal system used by the company and its partners.
                        </li>
                        <li>Participated in both frontend and backend development using PHP, JavaScript, and SQL.</li>
                        <li>Designed and executed manual test cases to ensure system reliability and functionality.</li>
                        <li>Reported bugs, validated feature requirements, and assisted in user acceptance testing
                          (UAT).</li>
                      </ul>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                      <ul class="list-disc pl-5">
                        <li>Gained hands-on experience across the full software development lifecycle (SDLC).</li>
                        <li>Collaborated with cross-functional teams to improve system quality and performance.</li>
                        <li>Strengthened skills in problem-solving, system logic, and code debugging.</li>
                      </ul>
                    </div>
                  </div>

                  <hr class="border border-gray-300 mt-3 mb-3">

                  <!-- Skills Section -->
                  <button @click="skillsOpen = !skillsOpen"
